OL,3,AGirl group Katseye are missing two
OL,4,Amembers, but their tour still dazzles
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey may have been two members down,
OL,7,Fbut the pop group Katseye received a
OL,8,Fhero's welcome as they played their
OL,9,Ffirst full concert in the UK.
OL,11,FThe audience erupted with screams even
OL,12,Fbefore the show began, as the band
OL,13,Fbroadcast their music videos on the O2
OL,14,FArena's big screens, and the noise
OL,15,Fbarely dipped for the next three hours.
OL,17,FIt was proof that Katseye have become
OL,18,Fpop's biggest property (they're
OL,19,Fcurrently the most-streamed act on
OL,20,FYouTube UK) even while singers Manon
OL,21,FBannerman and Sophia Laforteza are on
OL,22,Fhealth-related hiatus.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
